flowchart TD
    Listener[Listener<br/>describes request or sets profile]
    UI[Streamlit UI<br/>app.py]
    InputCheck[Input and profile guardrails<br/>src/guardrails.py]
    Agent[Recommender agent<br/>src/agent.py]
    Retriever[RAG retriever<br/>src/rag.py]
    Knowledge[(Music knowledge base<br/>data/knowledge_base.json)]
    Planner[Profile planner<br/>src/llm.py or offline rules]
    Catalog[(Song catalog<br/>data/songs.csv)]
    Ranker[Scoring and ranking<br/>src/recommender.py]
    OutputCheck[Recommendation output checks<br/>src/guardrails.py]
    Results[Ranked songs with explanations<br/>and retrieved source notes]
    HumanReview[Listener reviews results<br/>and changes request or profile]

    Eval[Reliability evaluator<br/>src/evaluate.py]
    Tests[Automated test suite<br/>tests/]
    Logs[(Redacted activity logs<br/>logs/tunejudge.log)]

    Listener -->|request or preferences| UI
    UI --> InputCheck
    InputCheck -->|free-text request| Agent
    InputCheck -->|validated profile| Ranker
    Agent -->|search request| Retriever
    Knowledge --> Retriever
    Retriever -->|relevant notes| Planner
    Agent -->|request plus context| Planner
    Planner -->|structured listener profile| InputCheck
    Ranker -->|ranked candidates| Agent
    Agent -->|self-check; revise plan when needed| Ranker
    Agent --> OutputCheck
    Ranker --> OutputCheck
    OutputCheck -->|safe, validated results| Results
    Results --> UI
    UI --> Listener
    Listener -->|feedback or updated request| UI

    Eval -->|golden cases, consistency, robustness| Agent
    Eval -->|profile and output checks| Ranker
    Tests -->|unit and integration checks| Agent
    Tests -->|unit and integration checks| Retriever
    Tests -->|guardrail and ranking checks| Ranker
    Agent -.-> Logs
    Eval -.-> Logs
